  "description": {
    "text": "The first of the yearly Happy Meal promotions Pokémon ran with McDonald's in North America. From 17 June to 7 July 2011, each Pokémon Black•White Happy Meal held one of these 12 holo cards and one of eight figures: Pikachu, Reshiram, Zekrom, Snivy, Tepig, Oshawott, Zorua and Zoroark. The Pokémon Company International said the promotion would go on to other major markets later in 2011 and in 2012, and it reached Europe and Canada.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "PocketMonsters.net: Pokémon Kicks off Its McDonald's Happy Meal Promotion in North America This Summer (the 2011 press release)",
        "url": "https://pocketmonsters.net/news/1078"
      },
      {
        "title": "Serebii: McDonalds Promos 2011",
        "url": "https://www.serebii.net/card/mcdonaldspromos2011/"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokumon: Pidove (11/12, McDonald's 2011)",
        "url": "https://pokumon.com/card/pidove-11-12-mcdonalds-mcdonalds-collection/"
      }
    ]
  },
